<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block line-height="1">This element should be used for postal addresses only. Within it, the generic element <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.addrLine" text-decoration="underline">&lt;addrLine&gt;</basic-link> may be used as an alternative to any of the more specialized elements available from the <inline color="black" font-family="Helvetica">model.addrPart</inline> class, such as <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.street" text-decoration="underline">&lt;street&gt;</basic-link>, <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.postCode" text-decoration="underline">&lt;postCode&gt;</basic-link> etc.</block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>Using just the elements defined by the core module, an address could be represented as follows:<block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;address&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;street&gt;</inline>via Marsala 24<inline>&lt;/street&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;postCode&gt;</inline>40126<inline>&lt;/postCode&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;name&gt;</inline>Bologna<inline>&lt;/name&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;name&gt;</inline>Italy<inline>&lt;/name&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/address&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>When a schema includes the names and dates module more specific elements such as country or settlement would be preferable over generic <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.name" text-decoration="underline">&lt;name&gt;</basic-link>:<block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;address&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;street&gt;</inline>via Marsala 24<inline>&lt;/street&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;postCode&gt;</inline>40126<inline>&lt;/postCode&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;settlement&gt;</inline>Bologna<inline>&lt;/settlement&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;country&gt;</inline>Italy<inline>&lt;/country&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/address&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;address&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;addrLine&gt;</inline>Computing Center, MC 135<inline>&lt;/addrLine&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;addrLine&gt;</inline>P.O. Box 6998<inline>&lt;/addrLine&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;addrLine&gt;</inline>Chicago, IL 60680<inline>&lt;/addrLine&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;addrLine&gt;</inline>USA<inline>&lt;/addrLine&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/address&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;address&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;country key="FR"/&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;settlement type="city"&gt;</inline>Lyon<inline>&lt;/settlement&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;postCode&gt;</inline>69002<inline>&lt;/postCode&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;district type="arrondissement"&gt;</inline>IIème<inline>&lt;/district&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;district type="quartier"&gt;</inline>Perrache<inline>&lt;/district&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;street&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;num&gt;</inline>30<inline>&lt;/num&gt;</inline>, Cours de Verdun<inline>&lt;/street&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/address&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Content model</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">
&lt;content&gt;
 &lt;sequence&gt;
  &lt;classRef key="model.global"
   minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"/&gt;
  &lt;sequence minOccurs="1"
   maxOccurs="unbounded"&gt;
   &lt;classRef key="model.addrPart"/&gt;
   &lt;classRef key="model.global"
    minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded"/&gt;
  &lt;/sequence&gt;
 &lt;/sequence&gt;
&lt;/content&gt;
    </block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Schema Declaration</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">
element address
{
   tei_att.global.attributes,
   tei_att.canonical.attributes,
   tei_att.cmc.attributes,
   tei_att.typed.attribute.subtype,
   attribute type
   {
      "billing" | "delivery" | "mailing" | "military" | "physical"
   }?,
   attribute role { list { + } }?,
   ( tei_model.global*, ( ( tei_model.addrPart, tei_model.global* )+ ) )
}</block></block></table-cell></table-row></table-body></table>
