<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block line-height="1">The result of the substitution may be either an absolute or a relative URI reference. In the latter case it is combined with the value of <inline font-style="italic">xml:base</inline> in force at the place where the <inline font-style="italic">cRef</inline> attribute occurs to form an absolute URI in the usual manner as prescribed by <basic-link external-destination="url(https://www.w3.org/TR/xmlbase/)">XML Base</basic-link>.</block></block></table-cell></table-row>
