<table-row><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>scheme</block></table-cell><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>identifies the classification scheme within which the set of categories concerned is defined, for example by a <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.taxonomy" text-decoration="underline">&lt;taxonomy&gt;</basic-link> element, or by some other resource.<table text-align="left" font-size="9pt" id="d27e38508"><table-column column-number="1" column-width="20%"/><table-column column-number="2" column-width="80%"/><table-body text-indent="0pt">
