<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;cit&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;quote&gt;</inline>and the breath of the whale is frequently attended with such an insupportable smell,
   as to bring on disorder of the brain.<inline>&lt;/quote&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;bibl&gt;</inline>Ulloa's South America<inline>&lt;/bibl&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/cit&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;entry&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;form&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;orth&gt;</inline>horrifier<inline>&lt;/orth&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;/form&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;cit type="translation" xml:lang="en"&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;quote&gt;</inline>to horrify<inline>&lt;/quote&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;/cit&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;cit type="example"&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;quote&gt;</inline>elle était horrifiée par la dépense<inline>&lt;/quote&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;cit type="translation" xml:lang="en"&gt;</inline>
   <inline>&lt;quote&gt;</inline>she was horrified at the expense.<inline>&lt;/quote&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;/cit&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;/cit&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/entry&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;cit type="example"&gt;</inline>
