<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>If all that is desired is to call attention to the fact that the copy text has been corrected, <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.corr" text-decoration="underline">&lt;corr&gt;</basic-link> may be used alone:<block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">I don't know,
 Juan. It's so far in the past now — how <inline>&lt;corr&gt;</inline>can we<inline>&lt;/corr&gt;</inline> prove
 or disprove anyone's theories?</block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>It is also possible, using the <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.choice" text-decoration="underline">&lt;choice&gt;</basic-link> and <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.sic" text-decoration="underline">&lt;sic&gt;</basic-link> elements, to provide an uncorrected reading:<block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">I don't know, Juan. It's so far in the past now —
 how <inline>&lt;choice&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;sic&gt;</inline>we can<inline>&lt;/sic&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;corr&gt;</inline>can we<inline>&lt;/corr&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/choice&gt;</inline> prove or
 disprove anyone's theories?</block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Content model</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">
&lt;content&gt;
 &lt;macroRef key="macro.paraContent"/&gt;
&lt;/content&gt;
    </block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Schema Declaration</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">
element corr
{
   tei_att.global.attributes,
   tei_att.cmc.attributes,
   tei_att.editLike.attributes,
