<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;div type="chapter"&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;p&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;!-- ... --&gt;</inline> and his heart was going like mad and yes I said yes I will Yes.<inline>&lt;/p&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;closer&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;dateline&gt;</inline>
   <inline>&lt;name type="place"&gt;</inline>Trieste-Zürich-Paris,<inline>&lt;/name&gt;</inline>
   <inline>&lt;date&gt;</inline>1914–1921<inline>&lt;/date&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;/dateline&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;/closer&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/div&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
