<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block line-height="1">Cf. the <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.imprint" text-decoration="underline">&lt;imprint&gt;</basic-link> element of bibliographic citations. As with title, author, and editions, the shorter name is reserved for the element likely to be used more often.</block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;docImprint&gt;</inline>Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1987<inline>&lt;/docImprint&gt;</inline></block>Imprints may be somewhat more complex: <block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;docImprint&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;pubPlace&gt;</inline>London<inline>&lt;/pubPlace&gt;</inline>
 Printed for <inline>&lt;name&gt;</inline>E. Nutt<inline>&lt;/name&gt;</inline>,
 at
<inline>&lt;pubPlace&gt;</inline>Royal Exchange<inline>&lt;/pubPlace&gt;</inline>;
<inline>&lt;name&gt;</inline>J. Roberts<inline>&lt;/name&gt;</inline> in
<inline>&lt;pubPlace&gt;</inline>wick-Lane<inline>&lt;/pubPlace&gt;</inline>;
<inline>&lt;name&gt;</inline>A. Dodd<inline>&lt;/name&gt;</inline> without
<inline>&lt;pubPlace&gt;</inline>Temple-Bar<inline>&lt;/pubPlace&gt;</inline>;
 and <inline>&lt;name&gt;</inline>J. Graves<inline>&lt;/name&gt;</inline> in
<inline>&lt;pubPlace&gt;</inline>St. James's-street.<inline>&lt;/pubPlace&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;date&gt;</inline>1722.<inline>&lt;/date&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/docImprint&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Content model</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">
&lt;content&gt;
 &lt;alternate minOccurs="0"
  maxOccurs="unbounded"&gt;
  &lt;textNode/&gt;
  &lt;classRef key="model.gLike"/&gt;
  &lt;classRef key="model.phrase"/&gt;
  &lt;elementRef key="pubPlace"/&gt;
  &lt;elementRef key="docDate"/&gt;
  &lt;elementRef key="publisher"/&gt;
  &lt;classRef key="model.global"/&gt;
 &lt;/alternate&gt;
&lt;/content&gt;
    </block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Schema Declaration</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">
element docImprint
{
   tei_att.global.attributes,
   (
      text
    | tei_model.gLike
    | tei_model.phrase
    | tei_pubPlace
    | tei_docDate
    | tei_publisher
    | tei_model.global
   )*
}</block></block></table-cell></table-row></table-body></table>
