 <inline>&lt;p&gt;</inline>Basic encoding, capturing lexical information only. All
   hyphenation, punctuation, and variant spellings normalized. No
   formatting or layout information preserved.<inline>&lt;/p&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/encodingDesc&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
