<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block line-height="1">The content of this element should be the expanded abbreviation, usually (but not always) a complete word or phrase. The <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.ex" text-decoration="underline">&lt;ex&gt;</basic-link> element provided by the <inline color="black" font-family="Helvetica">transcr</inline> module may be used to mark up sequences of letters supplied within such an expansion.</block><block line-height="1" text-indent="1em" space-before.optimum="0pt" space-before.maximum="12pt">If abbreviations are expanded silently, this practice should be documented in the <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.editorialDecl" text-decoration="underline">&lt;editorialDecl&gt;</basic-link>, either with a <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.normalization" text-decoration="underline">&lt;normalization&gt;</basic-link> element or a <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.p" text-decoration="underline">&lt;p&gt;</basic-link>.</block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">The address is Southmoor
<inline>&lt;choice&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;expan&gt;</inline>Road<inline>&lt;/expan&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;abbr&gt;</inline>Rd<inline>&lt;/abbr&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/choice&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;choice xml:lang="la"&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;abbr&gt;</inline>Imp<inline>&lt;/abbr&gt;</inline>
