<block text-align="start" font-weight="bold" keep-together.within-line="always">fact</block></list-item-label><list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><block font-weight="normal"><block> </block>the text is to be regarded as entirely informative or factual</block></list-item-body></list-item><list-item space-before.optimum="4pt"><list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
