<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block line-height="1">The <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.headItem" text-decoration="underline">&lt;headItem&gt;</basic-link> element may appear only if each item in the list is preceded by a <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.label" text-decoration="underline">&lt;label&gt;</basic-link>.</block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">The simple, straightforward statement of an
 idea is preferable to the use of a worn-out expression. <inline>&lt;list type="gloss"&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;headLabel rend="smallcaps"&gt;</inline>TRITE<inline>&lt;/headLabel&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;headItem rend="smallcaps"&gt;</inline>SIMPLE, STRAIGHTFORWARD<inline>&lt;/headItem&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;label&gt;</inline>bury the hatchet<inline>&lt;/label&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;item&gt;</inline>stop fighting, make peace<inline>&lt;/item&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;label&gt;</inline>at loose ends<inline>&lt;/label&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;item&gt;</inline>disorganized<inline>&lt;/item&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;label&gt;</inline>on speaking terms<inline>&lt;/label&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;item&gt;</inline>friendly<inline>&lt;/item&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;label&gt;</inline>fair and square<inline>&lt;/label&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;item&gt;</inline>completely honest<inline>&lt;/item&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;label&gt;</inline>at death's door<inline>&lt;/label&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;item&gt;</inline>near death<inline>&lt;/item&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/list&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
