<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block line-height="1">May contain simple prose or a sequence of chunks.</block><block line-height="1" text-indent="1em" space-before.optimum="0pt" space-before.maximum="12pt">Whatever string of characters is used to label a list item in the copy text may be used as the value of the global <inline font-style="italic">n</inline> attribute, but it is not required that numbering be recorded explicitly. In ordered lists, the <inline font-style="italic">n</inline> attribute on the <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.item" text-decoration="underline">&lt;item&gt;</basic-link> element is by definition synonymous with the use of the <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.label" text-decoration="underline">&lt;label&gt;</basic-link> element to record the enumerator of the list item. In glossary lists, however, the term being defined should be given with the <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.label" text-decoration="underline">&lt;label&gt;</basic-link> element, not <inline font-style="italic">n</inline>.</block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;list rend="numbered"&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;head&gt;</inline>Here begin the chapter headings of Book IV<inline>&lt;/head&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;item n="4.1"&gt;</inline>The death of Queen Clotild.<inline>&lt;/item&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;item n="4.2"&gt;</inline>How King Lothar wanted to appropriate one third of the Church revenues.<inline>&lt;/item&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;item n="4.3"&gt;</inline>The wives and children of Lothar.<inline>&lt;/item&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;item n="4.4"&gt;</inline>The Counts of the Bretons.<inline>&lt;/item&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;item n="4.5"&gt;</inline>Saint Gall the Bishop.<inline>&lt;/item&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;item n="4.6"&gt;</inline>The priest Cato.<inline>&lt;/item&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;item&gt;</inline> ...<inline>&lt;/item&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/list&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Content model</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">
&lt;content&gt;
 &lt;macroRef key="macro.specialPara"/&gt;
&lt;/content&gt;
    </block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Schema Declaration</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">
element item
{
   tei_att.global.attributes,
   tei_att.sortable.attributes,
   tei_macro.specialPara
}</block></block></table-cell></table-row></table-body></table>
