<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">May contain</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block><block><inline font-weight="bold">transcr: </inline><inline><basic-link internal-destination="TEI.transpose" text-decoration="underline">transpose</basic-link></inline></block></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;listTranspose&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;transpose&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;ptr target="#ib02"/&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;ptr target="#ib01"/&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;/transpose&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/listTranspose&gt;</inline></block>This example might be used for a source document which indicates in some way that the elements identified by <inline font-family="Courier">ib02</inline> and code <inline font-family="Courier">ib01</inline> should be read in that order (ib02 followed by ib01), rather than in the reading order in which they are presented in the source.</block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Content model</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">
&lt;content&gt;
 &lt;sequence&gt;
  &lt;elementRef key="desc" minOccurs="0"
   maxOccurs="unbounded"/&gt;
  &lt;elementRef key="transpose" minOccurs="1"
   maxOccurs="unbounded"/&gt;
 &lt;/sequence&gt;
&lt;/content&gt;
    </block></block></table-cell></table-row>
