<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block line-height="1">Suggested values for the <inline font-style="italic">type</inline> attribute include <inline>exact</inline> for exact equivalences, <inline>uppercase</inline> for uppercase equivalences, <inline>lowercase</inline> for lowercase equivalences, and <inline>simplified</inline> for simplified characters. The <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.g" text-decoration="underline">&lt;g&gt;</basic-link> elements contained by this element can point to either another <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.char" text-decoration="underline">&lt;char&gt;</basic-link> or <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.glyph" text-decoration="underline">&lt;glyph&gt;</basic-link> element or contain a character that is intended to be the target of this mapping.</block></block></table-cell></table-row>
