<table-row><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block line-height="1">Values for this attribute may be locally defined by a project, using arbitrary keywords such as <inline>movement</inline>, <inline>employers</inline>, <inline>relatives</inline>, or <inline>servants</inline>, each of which should be associated with a definition. Such local definitions will typically be provided by a <inline hyphenate="false" color="black" font-family="Courier">&lt;valList&gt;</inline> element in the project schema specification.</block></block></table-cell></table-row></table-body></table></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>sex</block></table-cell><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>specifies the sex of the participant group.<table text-align="left" font-size="9pt" id="d27e253932"><table-column column-number="1" column-width="20%"/><table-column column-number="2" column-width="80%"/><table-body text-indent="0pt">
