<table-row><table-cell number-columns-spanned="2" border-before-style="solid" border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">&lt;persona&gt; </inline>provides information about one of the personalities identified for a given individual, where an individual has multiple personalities. [<basic-link external-destination="url(https://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/ND.html#NDPERSE)">14.3.2. The Person Element</basic-link>]</block></table-cell></table-row>
