<table-row><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block line-height="1">Values for this attribute may be locally defined by a project, using arbitrary keywords such as <inline>artist</inline>, <inline>employer</inline>, <inline>author</inline>, <inline>relative</inline>, or <inline>servant</inline>, each of which should be associated with a definition. Such local definitions will typically be provided by a <inline hyphenate="false" color="black" font-family="Courier">&lt;valList&gt;</inline> element in the project schema specification.</block></block></table-cell></table-row></table-body></table></block></table-cell></table-row>
