<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;punctuation marks="all"
 placement="internal"&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;p&gt;</inline>All punctuation marks in the source text have been retained and represented using the
   appropriate Unicode code point. In cases where a punctuation mark and nearby markup convey
   the same information (for example, a sentence ends with a question mark and is also tagged
   as <inline>&lt;gi&gt;</inline>s<inline>&lt;/gi&gt;</inline>) the punctuation mark is captured as content within the element.<inline>&lt;/p&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/punctuation&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>External placement of punctuation:<block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;p&gt;</inline>I would agree with Saint Augustine that “<inline>&lt;quote&gt;</inline>An unjust law is no law at all<inline>&lt;/quote&gt;</inline>.”<inline>&lt;/p&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>Internal placement of punctuation:<block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;p&gt;</inline>I would agree with Saint Augustine that <inline>&lt;quote&gt;</inline>“An unjust law is no law at all.”<inline>&lt;/quote&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/p&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Schematron</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block>
&lt;sch:pattern is-a="declarable"&gt;
&lt;sch:param name="tde"
 value="tei:punctuation"/&gt;
&lt;/sch:pattern&gt;</block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Content model</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">
&lt;content&gt;
 &lt;classRef key="model.pLike" minOccurs="0"
  maxOccurs="unbounded"/&gt;
&lt;/content&gt;
    </block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Schema Declaration</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">
element punctuation
{
   tei_att.global.attributes,
   tei_att.declarable.attributes,
   attribute marks { "none" | "some" | "all" }?,
   attribute placement { "internal" | "external" }?,
   tei_model.pLike*
}</block></block></table-cell></table-row></table-body></table>
