<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block line-height="1">May be used to indicate that a passage is distinguished from the surrounding text for reasons concerning which no claim is made. When used in this manner, <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.q" text-decoration="underline">&lt;q&gt;</basic-link> may be thought of as syntactic sugar for <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.hi" text-decoration="underline">&lt;hi&gt;</basic-link> with a value of <inline font-style="italic">rend</inline> that indicates the use of such mechanisms as quotation marks.</block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">It is spelled <inline>&lt;q&gt;</inline>Tübingen<inline>&lt;/q&gt;</inline> — to enter the
 letter <inline>&lt;q&gt;</inline>u<inline>&lt;/q&gt;</inline> with an umlaut hold down the <inline>&lt;q&gt;</inline>option<inline>&lt;/q&gt;</inline> key and press 
<inline>&lt;q&gt;</inline>0 0 f c<inline>&lt;/q&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Content model</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">
&lt;content&gt;
 &lt;macroRef key="macro.specialPara"/&gt;
&lt;/content&gt;
    </block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Schema Declaration</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">
element q
{
   tei_att.global.attributes,
   tei_att.ascribed.directed.attributes,
   tei_att.cmc.attributes,
   tei_att.typed.attribute.subtype,
   attribute type
   {
      "spoken"
    | "thought"
    | "written"
    | "soCalled"
    | "foreign"
    | "distinct"
    | "term"
    | "emph"
    | "mentioned"
   }?,
   tei_macro.specialPara
}</block></block></table-cell></table-row></table-body></table>
<block keep-with-next.within-page="always" id="TEI.quotation" text-align="left" font-family="Times" font-size="14pt" font-weight="bold" space-after="3pt" space-before.optimum="9pt" text-indent="0em">1.320. &lt;quotation&gt;</block><table text-align="left" font-size="9pt" id="d27e272834"><table-column column-number="1" column-width="25%"/><table-column column-number="2" column-width="75%"/><table-body text-indent="0pt">
<table-row><table-cell number-columns-spanned="2" border-before-style="solid" border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">&lt;quotation&gt; </inline>(quotation) specifies editorial practice adopted with respect to quotation marks in the original. [<basic-link external-destination="url(https://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/HD.html#HD53)">2.3.3. The Editorial Practices Declaration</basic-link> <basic-link external-destination="url(https://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/CC.html#CCAS2)">16.3.2. Declarable Elements</basic-link>]</block></table-cell></table-row>
