<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>The word <inline font-style="italic" font-weight="normal">你 好</inline> <inline font-style="italic" font-weight="normal">nǐ hǎo</inline> (hello) is glossed in pinyin to provide a pronunciation guide.<block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;p xml:lang="zh"&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;!--...--&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;ruby&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;rb&gt;</inline>你<inline>&lt;/rb&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;rt place="above"&gt;</inline>nǐ<inline>&lt;/rt&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;/ruby&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;ruby&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;rb&gt;</inline>好<inline>&lt;/rb&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;rt place="above"&gt;</inline>hǎo<inline>&lt;/rt&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;/ruby&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;!--...--&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/p&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
