<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>If all that is desired is to call attention to the fact that the copy text has been regularized, <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.reg" text-decoration="underline">&lt;reg&gt;</basic-link> may be used alone:<block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;q&gt;</inline>Please <inline>&lt;reg&gt;</inline>knock<inline>&lt;/reg&gt;</inline> if an <inline>&lt;reg&gt;</inline>answer<inline>&lt;/reg&gt;</inline> is <inline>&lt;reg&gt;</inline>required<inline>&lt;/reg&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/q&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>It is also possible to identify the individual responsible for the regularization, and, using the <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.choice" text-decoration="underline">&lt;choice&gt;</basic-link> and <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.orig" text-decoration="underline">&lt;orig&gt;</basic-link> elements, to provide both the original and regularized readings:<block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;q&gt;</inline>Please <inline>&lt;choice&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;reg resp="#LB"&gt;</inline>knock<inline>&lt;/reg&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;orig&gt;</inline>cnk<inline>&lt;/orig&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;/choice&gt;</inline> if an <inline>&lt;choice&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;reg&gt;</inline>answer<inline>&lt;/reg&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;orig&gt;</inline>nsr<inline>&lt;/orig&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;/choice&gt;</inline> is <inline>&lt;choice&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;reg&gt;</inline>required<inline>&lt;/reg&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;orig&gt;</inline>reqd<inline>&lt;/orig&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;/choice&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/q&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Content model</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">
&lt;content&gt;
 &lt;macroRef key="macro.paraContent"/&gt;
&lt;/content&gt;
    </block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Schema Declaration</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">
element reg
{
   tei_att.global.attributes,
   tei_att.cmc.attributes,
   tei_att.editLike.attributes,
   tei_att.typed.attributes,
   tei_macro.paraContent
}</block></block></table-cell></table-row></table-body></table>
