<block keep-with-next.within-page="always" id="TEI.respStmt" text-align="left" font-family="Times" font-size="14pt" font-weight="bold" space-after="3pt" space-before.optimum="9pt" text-indent="0em">1.340. &lt;respStmt&gt;</block><table text-align="left" font-size="9pt" id="d27e288508"><table-column column-number="1" column-width="25%"/><table-column column-number="2" column-width="75%"/><table-body text-indent="0pt">
<table-row><table-cell number-columns-spanned="2" border-before-style="solid" border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">&lt;respStmt&gt; </inline>(statement of responsibility) supplies a statement of responsibility for the intellectual content of a text, edition, recording, or series, where the specialized elements for authors, editors, etc. do not suffice or do not apply. May also be used to encode information about individuals or organizations which have played a role in the production or distribution of a bibliographic work. [<basic-link external-destination="url(https://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/CO.html#COBICOR)">3.12.2.2. Titles, Authors, and Editors</basic-link> <basic-link external-destination="url(https://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/HD.html#HD21)">2.2.1. The Title Statement</basic-link> <basic-link external-destination="url(https://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/HD.html#HD22)">2.2.2. The Edition Statement</basic-link> <basic-link external-destination="url(https://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/HD.html#HD26)">2.2.5. The Series Statement</basic-link>]</block></table-cell></table-row>
