<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">May contain</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block><block><inline font-weight="bold">certainty: </inline><inline><basic-link internal-destination="TEI.certainty" text-decoration="underline">certainty</basic-link> <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.precision" text-decoration="underline">precision</basic-link> <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.respons" text-decoration="underline">respons</basic-link></inline></block></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block line-height="1">The <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.respons" text-decoration="underline">&lt;respons&gt;</basic-link> element is designed for cases in which fine-grained information about specific aspects of the markup of a text is desirable for whatever reason. Global responsibility for certain aspects of markup is usually more simply indicated in the TEI header, using the <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.respStmt" text-decoration="underline">&lt;respStmt&gt;</basic-link> element within the title statement, edition statement, or change log.</block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;respons target="#p1" locus="name location"
 resp="#encoder1"/&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;respons target="#p2" match="@rend"
 locus="value" resp="#encoder2"/&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;list type="encoders"&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;item xml:id="encoder1"/&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;item xml:id="encoder2"/&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/list&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>In this (partially fictional) example the entire document was transcribed and encoded by a single encoder, except for one passage which was transcribed and encoded by the proofreader.<block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">
<inline>&lt;!-- in the &lt;teiHeader&gt;: --&gt;</inline><inline>&lt;respStmt xml:id="enc01"&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;name&gt;</inline>C. Colin Backslash<inline>&lt;/name&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;resp&gt;</inline>transcription<inline>&lt;/resp&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;resp&gt;</inline>encoding<inline>&lt;/resp&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/respStmt&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;respStmt xml:id="prf01"&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;name&gt;</inline>Erin Spelling<inline>&lt;/name&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;resp&gt;</inline>proofreading<inline>&lt;/resp&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/respStmt&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;!-- in the &lt;text&gt;: --&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;p&gt;</inline>Θερινὴ τροπή
<inline>&lt;lb/&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;foreign xml:lang="hbo" xml:id="mp0a8"&gt;</inline> ת
 <inline>&lt;supplied reason="undefined"&gt;</inline>קו<inline>&lt;/supplied&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;unclear&gt;</inline>פ<inline>&lt;/unclear&gt;</inline>
   ת תמוז
 <inline>&lt;/foreign&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/p&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;!-- elsewhere: --&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;respons target="#mp0a8" locus="name value"
 resp="#prf01"/&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>In this (partially fictional) example an initial encoder (‘across.dta’) encoded most of the document; a later encoder (‘rcapolung.ewo’) encoded a particular passage; and a third encoder (‘sbauman.emt’) fixed some of that encoding.<block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">
<inline>&lt;!-- in the &lt;teiHeader&gt;: --&gt;</inline><inline>&lt;respStmt xml:id="enc03"&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;persName ref="../contextual/persons.xml#across.dta"/&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;resp&gt;</inline>encoding<inline>&lt;/resp&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/respStmt&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;!-- in the &lt;text&gt;: --&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;spGrp rend="braced(atonce1)"
 xml:id="sgrp05"&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;sp who="#mo"&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;speaker rend="align(left)slant(italic)"&gt;</inline>
   <inline>&lt;persName&gt;</inline>Mor<inline>&lt;/persName&gt;</inline>.<inline>&lt;/speaker&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;p rend="break(no)"&gt;</inline>So, so, so!<inline>&lt;/p&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;/sp&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;sp who="#hg"&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;speaker rend="align(left)slant(italic)"&gt;</inline>
   <inline>&lt;persName&gt;</inline>Mr. H<inline>&lt;/persName&gt;</inline>.<inline>&lt;/speaker&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;p rend="break(no)"&gt;</inline>What, without my Leave!<inline>&lt;/p&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;/sp&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;sp who="#la"&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;speaker rend="align(left)slant(italic)"&gt;</inline>
   <inline>&lt;persName&gt;</inline>Lady D<inline>&lt;/persName&gt;</inline>.<inline>&lt;/speaker&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;p rend="break(no)"&gt;</inline>Amazing!<inline>&lt;/p&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;/sp&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/spGrp&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;stage rend="align(right)slant(italic)"
 type="delivery" xml:id="atonce1"&gt;</inline>All together.<inline>&lt;/stage&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;!-- anywhere: --&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;respons target="#sgrp05" locus="name"
 resp="../contextual/persons.xml#rcapolung.ewo"&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;desc&gt;</inline>Ashley did not know what to do with this; I have decided it
   best fits as a braced <inline>&lt;gi&gt;</inline>spGrp<inline>&lt;/gi&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;/desc&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/respons&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;respons target="#sgrp05" match=".//@rend"
 locus="value"
 resp="../contextual/persons.xml#sbauman.emt"&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;desc&gt;</inline>fixed <inline>&lt;att&gt;</inline>rend<inline>&lt;/att&gt;</inline> attributes<inline>&lt;/desc&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/respons&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Content model</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">
&lt;content&gt;
 &lt;alternate minOccurs="0"
  maxOccurs="unbounded"&gt;
  &lt;classRef key="model.descLike"/&gt;
  &lt;classRef key="model.certLike"/&gt;
 &lt;/alternate&gt;
&lt;/content&gt;
    </block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Schema Declaration</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">
element respons
{
   tei_att.global.attributes,
   tei_att.scoping.attributes,
   attribute locus
   {
      list { ( "name" | "start" | "end" | "location" | "value" )+ }
   },
   ( tei_model.descLike | tei_model.certLike )*
}</block></block></table-cell></table-row></table-body></table>
