<table-row><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block line-height="1">Within a particular scope, all <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.rhyme" text-decoration="underline">&lt;rhyme&gt;</basic-link> elements with the same value for their <inline font-style="italic">label</inline> attribute are assumed to rhyme with each other. The scope is defined by the nearest ancestor element for which the <inline font-style="italic">rhyme</inline> attribute has been supplied.</block></block></table-cell></table-row></table-body></table></block></table-cell></table-row></table-body></table></block></table-cell></table-row>
