<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;lg rhyme="abababcc"&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>'Tis pity learned virgins ever <inline>&lt;rhyme label="a"&gt;</inline>wed<inline>&lt;/rhyme&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>With persons of no sort of edu<inline>&lt;rhyme label="b"&gt;</inline>cation<inline>&lt;/rhyme&gt;</inline>,<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>Or gentlemen, who, though well born and <inline>&lt;rhyme label="a"&gt;</inline>bred<inline>&lt;/rhyme&gt;</inline>,<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>Grow tired of scientific conver<inline>&lt;rhyme label="b"&gt;</inline>sation<inline>&lt;/rhyme&gt;</inline>:<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>I don't choose to say much on this <inline>&lt;rhyme label="a"&gt;</inline>head<inline>&lt;/rhyme&gt;</inline>,<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>I'm a plain man, and in a single <inline>&lt;rhyme label="b"&gt;</inline>station<inline>&lt;/rhyme&gt;</inline>,<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>But — Oh! ye lords of ladies inte<inline>&lt;rhyme label="c"&gt;</inline>llectual<inline>&lt;/rhyme&gt;</inline>,<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>Inform us truly, have they not hen-<inline>&lt;rhyme label="c"&gt;</inline>peck'd you all<inline>&lt;/rhyme&gt;</inline>?<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/lg&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;lg&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>Tyger! Tyger! burning <inline>&lt;rhyme label="a"&gt;</inline>bright<inline>&lt;/rhyme&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>In the forests of the <inline>&lt;rhyme label="a"&gt;</inline>night<inline>&lt;/rhyme&gt;</inline>,<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>What immortal hand or <inline>&lt;rhyme label="b"&gt;</inline>eye<inline>&lt;/rhyme&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>Could frame thy fearful <inline>&lt;rhyme label="b" type="eye-rhyme"&gt;</inline>symmetry<inline>&lt;/rhyme&gt;</inline>?<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/lg&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;lg&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>"Hark! Lakshman! Hark, again that <inline>&lt;rhyme label="a"&gt;</inline>cry<inline>&lt;/rhyme&gt;</inline>!<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>It is, — it is my husband's <inline>&lt;rhyme label="b"&gt;</inline>voice<inline>&lt;/rhyme&gt;</inline>!<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>hasten, to his succour <inline>&lt;rhyme label="a"&gt;</inline>fly<inline>&lt;/rhyme&gt;</inline>,<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>No more hast thou, dear friend, a <inline>&lt;rhyme label="b"&gt;</inline>choice<inline>&lt;/rhyme&gt;</inline>.<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>He calls on thee, perhaps his <inline>&lt;rhyme label="c"&gt;</inline>foes<inline>&lt;/rhyme&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>Environ him on all sides <inline>&lt;rhyme label="d"&gt;</inline>round<inline>&lt;/rhyme&gt;</inline>,<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>That wail, — it means death's final <inline>&lt;rhyme label="c"&gt;</inline>throes<inline>&lt;/rhyme&gt;</inline>!<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>Why standest thou, as magic-<inline>&lt;rhyme label="d"&gt;</inline>bound<inline>&lt;/rhyme&gt;</inline>?<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/lg&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Content model</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">
&lt;content&gt;
