<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">
<inline>&lt;!-- in the header --&gt;</inline><inline>&lt;editorialDecl&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;quotation marks="all"/&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/editorialDecl&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;!-- ... --&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;p&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;said&gt;</inline>"Our minstrel here will warm the old man's heart with song, dazzle him with jewels and
   gold"<inline>&lt;/said&gt;</inline>, a troublemaker simpered. <inline>&lt;said&gt;</inline>"He'll trample on the Duke's camellias, spill
   his wine, and blunt his sword, and say his name begins with X, and in the end the Duke
   will say, <inline>&lt;said&gt;</inline>'Take Saralinda, with my blessing, O lordly Prince of Rags and Tags, O
     rider of the sun!'<inline>&lt;/said&gt;</inline>"<inline>&lt;/said&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/p&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;p&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;said aloud="true" rend="pre(“) post(”)"&gt;</inline>Hmmm<inline>&lt;/said&gt;</inline>, said a small voice in his ear.
<inline>&lt;said aloud="true" rend="pre(“) post(”)"&gt;</inline>Difficult. Very difficult. Plenty of courage, I see.
   Not a bad mind either. there's talent, oh my goodness, yes — and a nice thirst to prove
   yourself, now that's interesting. … So where shall I put you?<inline>&lt;/said&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/p&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;p&gt;</inline>Harry gripped the edges of the stool and thought, <inline>&lt;said aloud="false" rend="italic"&gt;</inline>Not
   Slytherin, not Slytherin<inline>&lt;/said&gt;</inline>.<inline>&lt;/p&gt;</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Content model</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">
&lt;content&gt;
 &lt;macroRef key="macro.specialPara"/&gt;
&lt;/content&gt;
    </block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Schema Declaration</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">
element said
{
   tei_att.global.attributes,
   tei_att.ascribed.directed.attributes,
   tei_att.cmc.attributes,
   attribute aloud { text }?,
   attribute direct { text }?,
   tei_macro.specialPara
}</block></block></table-cell></table-row></table-body></table>
