<table-row><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>contemporary</block></table-cell><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>(contemporary) specifies whether or not the seal is contemporary with the item to which it is affixed<table text-align="left" font-size="9pt" id="d27e310203"><table-column column-number="1" column-width="20%"/><table-column column-number="2" column-width="80%"/><table-body text-indent="0pt">
<table-row><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Status</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>Optional</block></table-cell></table-row>
