<table-row><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block line-height="1">For irregular shapes in two dimensions, the value for this attribute should reflect the more important of the two dimensions. In conventional left-right scripts, a space with both vertical and horizontal components should be classed as <inline>vertical</inline>.</block></block></table-cell></table-row></table-body></table></block></table-cell></table-row></table-body></table></block></table-cell></table-row>
