<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">May contain</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>Empty element</block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;line&gt;</inline>This is <inline>&lt;del change="#s2" rend="overstrike"&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;seg xml:id="undo-a"&gt;</inline>just some<inline>&lt;/seg&gt;</inline>
   sample <inline>&lt;seg xml:id="undo-b"&gt;</inline>text<inline>&lt;/seg&gt;</inline>,
   we need<inline>&lt;/del&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;add change="#s2"&gt;</inline>not<inline>&lt;/add&gt;</inline>
 a real example.<inline>&lt;/line&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;undo target="#undo-a #undo-b"
 rend="dotted" change="#s3"/&gt;</inline></block>This encoding represents the following sequence of events: <list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="18pt" provisional-label-separation="6pt" text-indent="0em" margin-right="10pt" space-before="6pt" space-after="6pt"><list-item space-before.optimum="4pt"><list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
<block text-align="end">•</block></list-item-label><list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><block font-weight="normal">"This is just some sample text, we need a real example" is written</block></list-item-body></list-item><list-item space-before.optimum="4pt"><list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
<block text-align="end">•</block></list-item-label><list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><block font-weight="normal">At stage s2, "just some sample text, we need" is deleted by overstriking, and "not" is added </block></list-item-body></list-item><list-item space-before.optimum="4pt"><list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
<block text-align="end">•</block></list-item-label><list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><block font-weight="normal">At stage s3, parts of the deletion are cancelled by underdotting, thus reinstating the words "just some" and "text".</block></list-item-body></list-item></list-block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Content model</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt">
&lt;content&gt;
 &lt;empty/&gt;
&lt;/content&gt;
    </block></block></table-cell></table-row>
