<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">May contain</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block><block><inline font-weight="bold">iso-fs: </inline><inline><basic-link internal-destination="TEI.binary" text-decoration="underline">binary</basic-link> <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.default" text-decoration="underline">default</basic-link> <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.fs" text-decoration="underline">fs</basic-link> <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.numeric" text-decoration="underline">numeric</basic-link> <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.string" text-decoration="underline">string</basic-link> <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.symbol" text-decoration="underline">symbol</basic-link> <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.vAlt" text-decoration="underline">vAlt</basic-link> <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.vColl" text-decoration="underline">vColl</basic-link> <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.vLabel" text-decoration="underline">vLabel</basic-link> <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.vMerge" text-decoration="underline">vMerge</basic-link> <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.vNot" text-decoration="underline">vNot</basic-link></inline></block></block></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block font-family="Courier" background-color="lightgray" color="black" white-space-treatment="preserve" linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false" wrap-option="no-wrap" text-indent="0em" hyphenate="false" start-indent="12pt" text-align="start" font-size="6pt" space-before.optimum="4pt" space-after.optimum="4pt"><inline>&lt;vMerge org="list"&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;vColl org="set"&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;symbol value="masculine"/&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;symbol value="neuter"/&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;symbol value="feminine"/&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;/vColl&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;symbol value="indeterminate"/&gt;</inline>
<inline>&lt;/vMerge&gt;</inline></block>This example returns a list, concatenating the indeterminate value with the set of values masculine, neuter and feminine.</block></table-cell></table-row>
