<table-row><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>rotate</block></table-cell><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>indicates the amount by which this zone has been rotated clockwise, with respect to the normal orientation of the parent <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.surface" text-decoration="underline">&lt;surface&gt;</basic-link> element as implied by the dimensions given in the <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.msDesc" text-decoration="underline">&lt;msDesc&gt;</basic-link> element or by the coordinates of the <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.surface" text-decoration="underline">&lt;surface&gt;</basic-link> itself. The orientation is expressed in arc degrees.<table text-align="left" font-size="9pt" id="d27e398166"><table-column column-number="1" column-width="20%"/><table-column column-number="2" column-width="80%"/><table-body text-indent="0pt">
<table-row><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Status</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>Optional</block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Datatype</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><basic-link internal-destination="TEI.teidata.numeric" text-decoration="underline">teidata.numeric</basic-link></block></table-cell></table-row>
