<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block line-height="1">A ‘detail’ child element may not occur unless an ‘agency’ child element precedes it.</block><block line-height="1" text-indent="1em" space-before.optimum="0pt" space-before.maximum="12pt">See also <inline color="black" font-family="Helvetica">model.publicationStmtPart.agency</inline>.</block></block></table-cell></table-row></table-body></table>
