<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block line-height="1">These elements may appear anywhere within the elements <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.lem" text-decoration="underline">&lt;lem&gt;</basic-link> and <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.rdg" text-decoration="underline">&lt;rdg&gt;</basic-link>, and also within any of their constituent elements.</block></block></table-cell></table-row></table-body></table>
