<table-row><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Datatype</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>1–∞ occurrences of <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.teidata.pointer" text-decoration="underline">teidata.pointer</basic-link> separated by whitespace</block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block line-height="1">When multiple values are given, they may reflect either multiple divergent interpretations of an ambiguous text, or multiple mutually consistent interpretations of the same passage in different contexts.</block></block></table-cell></table-row></table-body></table></block></table-cell></table-row></table-body></table></block></table-cell></table-row></table-body></table>
