<table-row><table-cell number-columns-spanned="2" border-before-style="solid" border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">att.global.source</inline> provides attributes used by elements to point to an external source. [<basic-link external-destination="url(https://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/ST.html#STGAso)">1.3.1.1.4. Sources, certainty, and responsibility</basic-link> <basic-link external-destination="url(https://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/CO.html#COHQQ)">3.3.3. Quotation</basic-link> <basic-link external-destination="url(https://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/TS.html#TSBAWR)">8.3.4. Writing</basic-link>]</block></table-cell></table-row>
