<table-row><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Legal values are:</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="18pt" provisional-label-separation="6pt" text-indent="0em" margin-right="10pt" space-before="6pt" space-after="6pt"><list-item space-before.optimum="4pt"><list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
<block text-align="start" font-weight="bold" keep-together.within-line="always">yes</block></list-item-label><list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><block font-weight="normal"><block> </block>(yes) the name component is spelled out in full.<inline>[Default] </inline></block></list-item-body></list-item><list-item space-before.optimum="4pt"><list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
<block text-align="start" font-weight="bold" keep-together.within-line="always">abb</block></list-item-label><list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><block font-weight="normal"><block> </block>(abbreviated) the name component is given in an abbreviated form.</block></list-item-body></list-item><list-item space-before.optimum="4pt"><list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
<block text-align="start" font-weight="bold" keep-together.within-line="always">init</block></list-item-label><list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><block font-weight="normal"><block> </block>(initial letter) the name component is indicated only by one initial.</block></list-item-body></list-item></list-block></block></table-cell></table-row></table-body></table></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>sort</block></table-cell><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>(sort) specifies the sort order of the name component in relation to others within the name.<table text-align="left" font-size="9pt" id="d27e436397"><table-column column-number="1" column-width="20%"/><table-column column-number="2" column-width="80%"/><table-body text-indent="0pt">
