<table-row><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>varSeq</block></table-cell><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>(variant sequence) provides a number indicating the position of this reading in a sequence, when there is reason to presume a sequence to the variants. <table text-align="left" font-size="9pt" id="d27e438778"><table-column column-number="1" column-width="20%"/><table-column column-number="2" column-width="80%"/><table-body text-indent="0pt">
