<table-row><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block line-height="1">Different variant sequences could be coded with distinct number trails: 1-2-3 for one sequence, 5-6-7 for another. More complex variant sequences, with (for example) multiple branchings from single readings, may be expressed through the <inline hyphenate="false" color="black" font-family="Courier">&lt;join&gt;</inline> element.</block></block></table-cell></table-row></table-body></table></block></table-cell></table-row>
<table-row><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>require</block></table-cell><table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block>points to other readings that are required when adopting the current reading or lemma.<table text-align="left" font-size="9pt" id="d27e438811"><table-column column-number="1" column-width="20%"/><table-column column-number="2" column-width="80%"/><table-body text-indent="0pt">
