<table-row><table-cell number-columns-spanned="2" border-before-style="solid" border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">teidata.gender</inline> defines the range of attribute values used to represent the gender of a person, persona, or character.</block></table-cell></table-row>
