<table-row><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline></block></table-cell><table-cell border-after-style="solid" border-end-style="solid" border-start-style="solid" padding="2pt" text-align="left"><block><block line-height="1">The range of syntactically valid values is defined by <basic-link external-destination="url(https://www.ietf.org/rfc/rfc3986.txt)">RFC 3986</basic-link> <inline font-style="italic">Uniform Resource Identifier (URI): Generic Syntax</inline>. Note that the values themselves are encoded using <basic-link external-destination="url(https://www.ietf.org/rfc/rfc3987.txt)">RFC 3987</basic-link> <inline font-style="italic">Internationalized Resource Identifiers</inline> (IRIs) mapping to URIs. For example, <inline font-family="Courier">https://secure.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/wiki/%</inline> is encoded as <inline font-family="Courier">https://secure.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/wiki/%25</inline> while <inline font-family="Courier">http://موقع.وزارة-الاتصالات.مصر/</inline> is encoded as <inline font-family="Courier">http://xn--4gbrim.xn----rmckbbajlc6dj7bxne2c.xn--wgbh1c/</inline></block></block></table-cell></table-row></table-body></table>
